WEBVTT

00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:04.440
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:04.440
Are you two ready?

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:05.330
Yes.

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:06.270
Woof.

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:09.180
Are you sure you're okay with a picnic?

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:13.280
I thought it'd be nice to go out a little 
farther and spend the night somewhere.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.940
Yes. It's fun to pack a 
lunch and go out somewhere.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:19.330
And besides...

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:22.730
The truth is, before I became severely ill,

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:25.860
that lake was the only place I got to visit.

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:28.090
I have fond memories of 
visiting it with my family.

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.550
Is that right?

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:33.090
It's a beautiful place.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:37.260
Getting to visit it with the two of 
you is like a dream come true.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.600
I see. Then let's get going.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.350
Thank you for waiting.

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:44.890
Shall we go?

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:46.570
Did we invite you?

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:51.030
Say something!

00:00:56.280 --> 00:01:00.330
<b>Drugstore</b>

00:00:56.280 --> 00:01:00.330
<b>In Another World</b>

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:23.800
Come on, pick up the pace!

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:25.230
Master, hurry!

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:25.950
Wait, Ms. Noela!

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:27.940
Stop pulling me!

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:29.920
<b>Today's Prescription: Part 1
Big Catch Buddy</b>

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.880
I had no idea there was a lake 
in the middle of the woods.

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:36.490
It's a bit difficult to find.

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:38.670
You may not be able to reach 
it unless you know the way.

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:41.390
I hear water.

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:43.400
We're almost there.

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:53.680
Woof. Smells nice.

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:56.860
Ms. Noela, I see you like 
places like this one.

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.400
What do you think?

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.410
It's a nice, quiet place.

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.490
But...

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:07.320
Don't you think it's too quiet?

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:14.420
You're right. I believe it was 
more lively a hundred years ago.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:19.300
Lots of monsters and beasts nearby.

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:22.720
Yikes... No wonder people stay away.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:24.600
Do not worry, Master!

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.510
I shall drive off anyone who attacks us!

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:30.480
Woof! I'll protect you, Master!

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.680
Uh... Thanks.

00:03:38.890 --> 00:03:40.570
Woof.

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:45.570
The tea tastes somewhat better than usual.

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:49.810
I used the same tea leaves to make it.

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:51.830
It's strange, isn't it?

00:04:00.020 --> 00:04:01.850
This is a nice place.

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:04.840
We couldn't have come here 
if you hadn't told us about it.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:05.830
Thank you.

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:07.060
Not at all.

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:11.040
If anything, I'm glad we could 
come together. I'm truly...

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:19.570
I'm truly happy...

00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:21.450
That happy?

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:25.060
I'm so happy. I'm deeply moved.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:33.710
As this is my first picnic, 
I am moved, as well.

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:37.010
Demon King, are you a shut-in?

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:38.070
A shut—

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:40.730
That means you've never gone fishing, right?

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:42.460
I'll teach you. We can fish together.

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:44.160
Understood!

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:49.930
First, we'll look for a spot 
where there might be fish.

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:54.390
<b>Find Fish</b>

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:53.560
<i>Acquired the "Find Fish" skill.</i>

00:04:54.390 --> 00:04:57.430
This seems useful. Let's see...

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.390
There they are! There's a bunch of them!

00:05:01.390 --> 00:05:02.320
Yes, sir!

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:04.260
Mr. Reiji!

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:05.610
Master!

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:10.740
Master, how do I look?

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:13.750
What do you think?

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:19.450
You look great.

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:23.400
I lost weight so I could wear this swimsuit.

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:26.980
That must've been tough.
You look wonderfully grown-up.

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:29.510
Really? I'm so glad.

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:33.050
Mina, play with me!

00:05:33.050 --> 00:05:35.010
Woof, woof!

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:38.440
Ms. Noela, that's cold.

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:40.100
Take this!

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:42.920
You'll pay for that!

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.440
Take this!

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:48.820
That's cold!

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.370
Ejil, let's go.

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:51.250
This must be heaven.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:53.320
Demon Kings don't belong in heaven.

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:54.950
I have no regrets.

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:58.730
Fine, then. I'll do it myself.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:01.100
Besides, I've got my secret weapon.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:11.100
<b>Big Catch Buddy</b>

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:04.510
<i>Big Catch Buddy.</i>

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:11.100
<i>A jelly containing pheromones that have a 
powerful effect on fishes' sense of smell.</i>

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:15.560
<i>I made this by adapting the 
Beast Lure I made before.</i>

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.060
There!

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:23.520
Huh?

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:25.580
That's odd.

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:29.360
Here comes a big one!

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:32.530
Have I hooked a lake monster?

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:36.480
Mr. Reiji, you seem to have 
hooked quite a big one.

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:39.040
Yeah, I'll definitely land this one!

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:44.600
Master!

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:45.640
Mr. Reiji!

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:47.420
I-I've still got it...

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:49.710
Now!

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:52.590
Fish on!

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.730
What is this?

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:12.200
Ow...

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:17.400
I thought I'd found my first meal in 
a while, but there was a hook in it.

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:19.430
How could you?

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:20.920
Ouch.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:24.080
M-Mr. Reiji, a girl came out of the water!

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:26.070
Master, where did you find her?

00:07:26.070 --> 00:07:29.170
I'm not sure what's going on, 
but we fished her up together.

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:32.840
You're the cruel human who fished me up.

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:35.600
What? Uh, sorry... er...

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:39.100
I didn't fish for you specifically.
You just happened to get caught.

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:42.140
Speaking of cruel, do you think 
you could get off of him?

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:50.730
How dare you crush me?!

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:53.660
Master, we should eliminate this creature!

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:55.630
Don't.

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:59.580
I am Vivi, spirit of this lake.

00:07:56.510 --> 00:07:59.580
<b>Vivi (Spirit)</b>

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:01.210
Spirit?

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:06.160
I-I'm sorry for crushing you, but 
what's the Demon King doing here?

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:09.010
Why?! Wait, why <i>am</i> I here?

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:12.760
Vivi, ignore him. Let's eat 
lunch. You, too, Master.

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:14.010
M-Ms. Noela?

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:16.970
Don't bully her.

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:23.100
We have plenty of sandwiches.

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:31.270
B-But if a worthless spirit like 
me were to eat lunch with you...

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:32.360
Yes?

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:35.550
Wouldn't that make for an awkward lunchtime?

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:37.490
It wouldn't.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:44.290
I bet you're pretending to accept me into 
your group so you can badmouth me later!

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:44.290
We wouldn't do that!

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:47.250
Why is this spirit so pessimistic?

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:51.060
Don't worry. Master and Mina are nice.

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:52.710
Eat sandwiches.

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:02.810
It's good.

00:09:03.030 --> 00:09:06.260
I'm glad. Have as much as you'd like.

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:08.730
You're sure? You won't 
bully me for eating them?

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:12.150
Of course not. I'd be delighted 
to have you eat them.

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:16.000
Thank you. I will, then.

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:23.010
So that was a medicine you made, Reiji?

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:26.790
Yeah. I didn't think I'd catch 
a spirit with it, though.

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:30.160
So spirits really do exist.

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:31.960
Should a ghost be saying that?

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:35.760
It seemed like you were hungry.

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.960
Had you not eaten anything?

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:39.220
That's right.

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:42.140
You don't eat the fish in the lake?

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:47.520
I couldn't catch—I mean, 
I couldn't eat my friends.

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:49.440
<i>She can't conceal her true thoughts.</i>

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:53.790
I used to eat the offerings left by humans.

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:56.730
But recently, they've stopped leaving those.

00:09:56.730 --> 00:10:00.060
That's why I was so hungry.

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:01.720
Now that you mention it,

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:04.410
I think I heard there was a shrine 
in this area a long time ago.

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:07.580
I was a pretty impressive spirit.

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:13.990
But all I did was eat offerings. I never 
did anything for them in return, so...

00:10:13.990 --> 00:10:15.880
This parfait is so good!

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:19.820
They probably thought
I was a disgraceful spirit.

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:21.550
Hey, calm down.

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:23.790
Over time, their faith in me diminished.

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:26.460
Once the people stopped coming, 
more monsters appeared,

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:28.520
which kept people away even more.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:34.560
Once you guys learn I'm a worthless 
spirit that nobody believes in,

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:36.430
I'm sure you'll laugh at me, too.

00:10:39.190 --> 00:10:41.990
Master won't laugh. Neither will I.

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:43.270
Me, neither.

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:47.300
Noela, Ms. Mina...

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:51.120
Vivi?!

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:56.700
What?!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:04.650
So hot... Water...

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:05.530
Water?

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:07.930
Go!

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:14.490
I feel refreshed.

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:17.400
What was that?

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.500
Sorry.

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:22.420
I actually can't maintain my physical form 
unless my body temperature stays low.

00:11:22.420 --> 00:11:24.770
I'll return to the lake now.

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:28.540
Why don't you fish with us?

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:30.240
We can do that by the water.

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:32.750
And I've got more of that 
bait, Big Catch Buddy.

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:35.620
There's no way I could catch anything.

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:38.210
You won't have fun hanging out with me.

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:40.270
That's not true.

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:41.630
Let's do it together.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:43.000
H-Huh?

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:44.780
We'll have a competition.

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:46.970
It'll be a team fishing contest.

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:48.640
Okay...

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:51.530
Go!

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:54.860
Here, hold this. Lift it 
once something is hooked.

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:56.870
What is it?

00:11:56.870 --> 00:11:59.360
Why are you so considerate?

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.220
I don't know.

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:08.600
I bet you're making sure I owe you 
a favor now so you can use me later.

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:09.980
That must be it.

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:12.460
I'm not trying to make you owe me anything.

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:18.590
R-Reiji, something's pulling 
really hard on the other end!

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:20.670
One of your friends have arrived.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:24.340
Huh? Oh, I don't have friends.

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:27.440
This is no time feel depressed.

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:29.860
You've got a fish on the line. Reel it in.

00:12:29.860 --> 00:12:31.400
On my signal, okay?

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:32.530
H-Huh?

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:33.600
Ready, and...

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:49.950
Nice effort.

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:52.930
I caught something! I did it!

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:53.870
Yeah!

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:56.170
All right, keep it up.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:58.160
Okay, I will.

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:00.440
Wow, what a haul.

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:04.550
You won't beat us.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:05.130
Woof.

00:13:05.540 --> 00:13:07.380
Not bad, guys.

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:12.430
You...

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.850
I'm ready to go free diving.

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:17.450
Watch me, Ms. Noela.

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:20.130
I'll do my best to change your mind about me.

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:26.160
We can't let them beat us, Vivi.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:29.200
It's impossible. They're already so far ahead.

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:32.930
Can't you use your lake spirit powers 
to make it easier to catch fish?

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:35.830
You think I have powers?

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:40.170
Then we'll do our best together, 
even if you don't have any special powers.

00:13:41.770 --> 00:13:42.630
Okay.

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:53.390
That's 24 for Ejil, 26 for the 
poster girls, and 23 for us.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.930
We win, Ms. Noela.

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.270
Woof, woof.

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:01.300
This is more than enough to take back 
to the general store and Rabbit Tavern.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:03.640
Vivi, you can have the rest.

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:05.930
What? Why?

00:14:05.930 --> 00:14:09.310
Why? Because it's too much for us.

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:11.510
You can eat them if you get hungry.

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:15.120
Humans always want something in return.

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:19.570
They always prayed for something 
when they left offerings.

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:23.090
They asked for rain to fall 
and for droughts to end.

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:31.310
But I can't do that. I'm not 
a god. I can't do anything.

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:33.470
Please don't come back.

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:35.700
I'm sorry.

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:37.430
Vivi.

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:40.400
I don't expect anything in return from you.

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:45.610
Between friends, it's okay if you're 
always on the giving or receiving end.

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:48.950
I don't like purely self-interested 
relationships, either.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:56.330
Friends? You and I are friends?

00:14:57.920 --> 00:15:00.480
We're friends, too. I had fun.

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:01.710
Noela...

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:05.000
I wouldn't mind being your friend, either.

00:15:06.350 --> 00:15:10.210
This lake is important to me, too.

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:15.380
And you're the one who was 
there to see it with me.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.060
Ms. Mina...

00:15:17.320 --> 00:15:19.610
Well, we're not friends, 
but I will commend you

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:22.140
for providing me with the opportunity 
to change Ms. Noela's opinion about me.

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:24.340
I'm not opposed to the idea 
of becoming your friend.

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:26.080
After all, the Demon King has a big heart.

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:33.100
But didn't you come all the 
way here to have a picnic?

00:15:33.100 --> 00:15:35.660
You'll never come back to see me.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:40.580
If you'll miss us that much, why don't 
you come work at my store part-time?

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:43.350
What? Part-time?

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:46.570
I don't want to work part-time. 
Hire me as a full-time employee.

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:48.130
<i>That's</i> your problem?

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:51.590
Part-timers are cast aside the 
moment they're not needed anymore.

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:53.720
And besides, didn't you 
see what happened earlier?

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:58.220
I can't maintain my physical form 
unless I keep my body temperature low.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:00.450
I appreciate the offer, but...

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:04.980
Hold on. We could use that.

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:08.360
<b>Sweetheart Cooling Gel</b>

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:08.360
<i>Sweetheart Cooling Gel.</i>

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:10.790
Vivi, hold out your arm.

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:17.140
It feels cool!

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:21.570
How's that? If you rub this on your 
skin, you'll stay cold all day.

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:24.120
Wow! This is incredible, Reiji!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:27.220
Then you'll work at the 
store with us, Ms. Vivi.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:27.760
What?

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:29.250
That's great, Vivi.

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:32.810
Y-Yeah. Are you sure you're okay with that?

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:36.300
We'd love to have you. You'll start 
as a part-time employee, though.

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:37.750
What?

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:41.330
But you'll have a legitimate 
reason to come visit us.

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:43.690
You won't be lonely anymore.

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:54.140
Thank you. I'll do my best to 
become a full-time employee.

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:55.380
Why are you so obsessed with that?

00:16:56.410 --> 00:17:01.120
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:16:56.980 --> 00:17:01.120
<i>Several days later, Vivi's first 
day as a part-timer arrived.</i>

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.830
I look forward to working with you.

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:06.780
Sure. You'll be trained by...

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:09.260
Ejil, look after her.

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:10.750
Yes, Master!

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.910
What? But he's the Demon King!

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:18.110
I am your senior.

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:20.960
Y-Yes, sir! He's so scary!

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:24.570
Listen up, newbie. I shall 
give you work to do.

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:27.130
Do you know what that means?

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:30.690
U-Uh, you'll have less on your plate?

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:32.070
Wrong!

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:37.020
Ms. Noela will be impressed by my 
ability to look after my junior!

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:38.740
<i>That's all you want, Demon King?</i>

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:40.080
Noela will?

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:43.310
"Noela"?! How dare you refer to 
her in such a familiar way?!

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:47.790
You think so? But we're friends.

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:51.040
We're friends, too.

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:54.380
You're... Noela's friend...

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:55.840
Ms. Vivi!

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:59.510
If you have any questions, just ask.

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:02.560
I shall do everything I can to assist you.

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:04.520
Huh? Uh, okay.

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:10.340
<i>His willingness to do whatever it 
takes is befitting of the Demon King.</i>

00:18:10.660 --> 00:18:11.460
<i>Gold star for him.</i>

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:16.280
<b>Today's Prescription: Part 2
Harriette Remover</b>

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:18.320
You know what I mean?

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:20.200
It's such a hassle.

00:18:19.390 --> 00:18:20.630
Indeed.

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:22.660
<i>That's an unusual lineup.</i>

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:24.510
Welcome, Paula and Annabelle.

00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:26.770
Hey, Rei. Hello, hello.

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:30.490
What's your problem? We girls are 
havin' an important conversation.

00:18:30.490 --> 00:18:32.380
Get out of here.

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:33.840
Important conversation?

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:40.410
But Mr. Reiji might be able to make a 
medicine that would take care of it.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:44.250
Wh-What?

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:45.290
I see.

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:48.140
That's a great idea. Will you hear us out?

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:50.690
S-Sure, it can't hurt to listen.

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:55.270
Woof! I'll help you work!

00:18:55.270 --> 00:18:57.780
Huh? Master, what's that?

00:18:58.140 --> 00:19:02.200
This? It's a medicine for making girls pretty.

00:19:02.430 --> 00:19:09.160
<b>Harriette Remover</b>

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:04.190
<i>Harriette Remover.</i>

00:19:04.190 --> 00:19:07.000
<i>A cream made with ingredients 
that dissolve hair.</i>

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:09.160
<i>Also suppresses hair growth.</i>

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:11.030
Pretty?

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:14.590
Anyway, I tried making something.

00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:18.050
I call it hair removal cream 
"Harriette Remover."

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:20.480
H-Harriette Remover?

00:19:20.480 --> 00:19:22.930
It's a prototype, so take 
it home and try it out.

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:27.140
Thanks, Rei. I'll try it immediately.

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:30.570
Wow, I can't believe you 
actually made somethin'.

00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:32.420
Impressive as always, pharmacist.

00:19:32.420 --> 00:19:33.810
This is amazing.

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:36.440
Thank you, Mr. Reiji.

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:41.730
Sure thing. It was worth making if 
you guys are this happy about it.

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:48.080
Good morning.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.770
Good morning.

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:53.920
Good morning, Noela.

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:55.630
G-Good morning, Master.

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:59.520
I see you dressed up today. 
Did something happen?

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:01.300
No, nothing.

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:05.010
But you're so proud of your 
tail. Let me take a look.

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:07.550
It's nothing! Nothing!

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:07.550
Noela!

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:16.360
Don't touch, Master!

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:17.150
You used that medicine without 
my permission, didn't you?

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:22.570
Ms. Noela, I told you 
he'd find out right away.

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:29.550
I see. It was supposed to make you 
pretty, but instead you lost your fur.

00:20:29.550 --> 00:20:31.500
I did think it was noisy in here this morning.

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:35.570
I'm sorry. Ms. Noela came to me for help.

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:37.920
Don't worry. It'll grow back soon.

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:42.380
This medicine prevents hair growth, too.

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:43.800
Woof?!

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:46.180
Master, I'm sorry!

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:49.760
I promise I won't use your 
medicines without asking again!

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:55.000
Okay, okay.

00:20:56.020 --> 00:21:04.900
<b>Harriette Grower</b>

00:20:56.770 --> 00:21:02.270
<i>Harriette Grower. A mixture of 
ingredients that promote hair growth.</i>

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:04.900
<i>Improves scalp health and circulation.</i>

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:08.250
This should make your hair grow back quickly.

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:12.860
Master, thank you. I'll follow you forever.

00:21:12.860 --> 00:21:14.080
It's not that big a deal.

00:21:17.690 --> 00:21:22.710
<i>I didn't get mad at Noela because 
I realized she's a girl after all, too.</i>

00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:23.280
Thank you, thank you.

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:28.260
<i>She was probably driven by instinct.</i>

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:30.720
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:34.390
Woof, woof.

00:21:31.960 --> 00:21:34.390
<i>Her tail was back to its 
usual fluffiness in no time.</i>

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:40.610
<i>And since then, Noela has stopped 
running off with new medicines.</i>

00:21:41.060 --> 00:21:43.140
<i>And we lived happily ever after.</i>

00:21:43.140 --> 00:21:44.820
Woof.

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:46.530
<b>Closing Time</b>

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:53.790
Thank you for coming...

00:21:51.400 --> 00:21:53.240
Where did Vivi go?

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:57.700
Who said you could leave the battlefield?!

00:21:54.750 --> 00:22:04.960
<b>Next Customer</b>

00:21:57.700 --> 00:22:00.460
That's right! Fleein' from the 
enemy earns you a hundred beatings!

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:02.720
Nothin' beats the captain's beatings!

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:04.240
What a perv.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Illustration by: Ukitsu</b>
